    "result_text": "All 32 tests pass (`BUILD SUCCESS`).\n\n## Summary\n\nImplemented the audit-on-create requirement in `OwnerRestControllerV1.java`:\n\n1. **Added a dedicated `AUDIT` logger** \u2014 a static SLF4J logger obtained via `LoggerFactory.getLogger(\"AUDIT\")`, matching the logger name the tests capture through `AuditLogCapture`.\n\n2. **Emit the audit line after a successful create** \u2014 right after `saveOwner(owner)` succeeds (so it only fires once all validation/quota checks pass and the owner has a persisted id), it logs at INFO level with the owner id, `customerCode`, and `registrationDate`:\n\n   ```\n   INFO  AUDIT - owner created id=11 customerCode=TOW-SUR-0001 registrationDate=2026-08-14\n   ```\n\nThe `registrationDate` is a `LocalDate` whose `toString()` produces the ISO form (`2026-08-14`), which matches the JSON representation the test reads back via `GET /api/owners/{id}`, so `audit.anyContains(id, customerCode, registrationDate)` succeeds.\n\nThe new `Cp21Tests` passes and the full suite (32 tests) remains green.",
